  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:390px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-Blue pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Hydro-Plasma Conversion</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4a/Eye_Beams_by_Black_Manta.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20170801083527\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Eye Beams by Black Manta\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4a/Eye_Beams_by_Black_Manta.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20170801083527\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4a/Eye_Beams_by_Black_Manta.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20170801083527 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/4/4a/Eye_Beams_by_Black_Manta.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1032?cb=20170801083527 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Eye Beams by Black Manta\" width=\"270\" height=\"415\" data-image-key=\"Eye_Beams_by_Black_Manta.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Eye Beams by Black Manta.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Black Manta's (DC Comics) helmet can absorb and convert water into beams of energized plasma.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb and convert water into energized plasma.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>convert water into energized plasma</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Conversion\" title=\"Energy Conversion\">Energy Conversion</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Techniques\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Techniques</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FHydro-Plasma_Conversion%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-sectio